{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfxkqovhhLirTKw6gC5ze","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LBHsiKGMuQwLnnFMDqthZ5","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-docs-6b-amend/docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md","old_string":"and the amendment residue is closed (§10.3 R9, U7). The frozen document\nis not changed by this one.","new_string":"and the amendment residue is closed (§10.3 R9, U7). **Revision 4\n(2026-10-13, Architect: claude-fable-5-1)** amends the text after slice\n6b merged (`1db08f7d`: `c3d37586` plus the fixes `a396f996`, `f650e046`,\n`bafdec74`), so that §§2.5-2.6, 5.2, 6.1, 6.3, 7, 8.2 state what\n`src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc` (`lift-task`, `lower-task`,\n`check-stores!`, `check-pendings!`, `check-dependencies!`,\n`check-custody!`, `discharge!`, `live-pcs`) does; every amended clause\nis marked \"**Amended after 6b**\" with what changed and why, §10.6\ninventories them, and §11 lists the design choices the code made that\nthe owner has not ruled on. Sources: the engineer report\n`collab/1792270000000-engineer-6b-task-transport.report.md` (design bugs\nB1-B4, deviations 1-10) and the three codex reviews\n(`collab/1792280000000-…`, `1792300000000-…`, `1792320000000-…`). The\nfrozen document is not changed by this one."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2931,"cache_read_input_tokens":152014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2931},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02df6bdc-04b9-48af-9b17-9798293c08e5","uuid":"42b920cf-fb38-40c1-af28-228a15d489ea","timestamp":"2026-10-12T17:43:27.725Z","request_i